[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0250","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24451","title":"Gitea 仓库分叉同步信息泄露漏洞","description":"Gitea 存在信息泄露漏洞。当上游仓库从公开仓库变更为私有仓库后，之前创建的 fork 仓库通过 `POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-upstream` 接口仍能继续同步上游仓库在私有期间提交的代码，导致本应受限的私有数据通过 fork 仓库泄露给未经授权的用户。攻击者只需在仓库公开时创建 fork，待其变为私有后执行同步操作即可获取私有代码。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24451","GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.4 或更高版本（v1.26.3 已包含修复，但官方强烈建议直接升级到 v1.26.4），升级后在父仓库改为私有时会自动阻断 fork 的 merge-upstream 同步请求。如无法立即升级，可临时在反向代理层屏蔽 POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-upstream 接口，或手动检查并删除不应继续拥有访问权限的 fork 仓库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24451.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-24451.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24451.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-24451.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-24451.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v/GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-24451.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-24451.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2026/FreeBSD-2026-0293.md","https://github.com/peleduri/zero-day-pulse/blob/d56f83f6d1e3899004c32c7c15cdd38e9dd954ba/docs/index.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0250.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0250.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0248","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-22874","title":"Gitea Webhook和迁移允许列表SSRF防护不完整漏洞","description":"Gitea 在 Webhook 投递和仓库迁移功能中使用了不完整的 SSRF 防护机制，其默认允许列表依赖 Go 标准库 `net.IP.IsPrivate()` 进行内网地址过滤，但该函数仅覆盖 RFC 1918 和 RFC 4193 定义的私有地址段，遗漏了云元数据服务、内部网络及 IPv6 过渡机制中使用的多个 IP 范围。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过构造指向这些未过滤地址段的请求，绕过 SSRF 防护，访问云服务元数据接口或内部系统，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.6，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-22874","GHSA-2r5c-gw76-rh3w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 1.26.4 或更高版本（官方强烈建议跳过 1.26.3 直接升级至 1.26.4）。升级后系统将收紧 Webhook 和仓库迁移的默认 SSRF 允许列表，补齐 `net.IP.IsPrivate()` 未涵盖的云元数据 IP 段及 IPv6 过渡地址范围。如无法立即升级，可在 `app.ini` 中手工配置 `[webhook]` 和 `[migration]` 下的 `ALLOWED_HOST_LIST` 选项，限制仅允许访问预期的外部地址，并阻断 169.254.169.0/24、100.64.0.0/10 等内部保留段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38059","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38173","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-2r5c-gw76-rh3w","https://github.com/Eliot-code/CVE-2026-22874-PoC","htt