任意用户身份访问 Gitea 实例。该漏洞影响 Gitea Docker 镜像 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者只需发送携带伪造标头的 HTTP 请求即可完成利用，无需任何权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20896","GHSA-f75j-4cw6-rmx4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea Docker 镜像至 1.26.4 或更高版本（1.26.3 因存在仓库代码页加载回归问题不建议使用）。如无法立即升级，在 Docker 的 app.ini 中将 `REVERSE_PROXY_TRUSTED_PROXIES` 从 `*` 改为实际反向代理 IP 段（如 `127.0.0.0/8,::1/128`），并确认 `ENABLE_REVERSE_PROXY_AUTHENTICATION` 仅在需要时手动开启。如无法修改配置，在防火墙/安全组层面限制 Gitea 实例仅允许信任的反向代理 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-f75j-4cw6-rmx4","https://github.com/rz1027/CVE-2026-20896","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-20896.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2026/CVE-2026-20896.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2026/CVE-2026-20896.yaml","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0e170467e8e76cab69d827be2a520352df55825c/doc/2026-07/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2026-20896%20%E6%8A%AB%E9%9C%B2%E4%BB%85%2013%20%E5%A4%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%A8%81%E8%83%81%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E8%80%85%E5%B7%B2%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%20Gitea%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%BC%80%E5%B1%95%E6%8E%A2%E6%B5%8B%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20896.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-20896.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-20896.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/9cd45c8ff86fc94d27c6255a665548fbf0c1c23f/2026/CVE-2026-20896/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-20896.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/326d1eb3c211c5432d4f6357a04093f6484ab9cc/archive/2026/2026-07-07.md","https://github.com/szybnev/cve-2026-20896-gitea-poc","https://github.com/XaocZenon/CVE-2026-20896","https://github.com/kaleth4/CVE-2026-20896"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0247.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0247.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0246","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-20779","title":"Gitea TOTP 一次性验证绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 双因素认证中存在 TOTP 单次使用校验缺陷，包括 Web 2FA 路径的 TOCTOU 竞争条件漏洞和 Basic-Auth 的 `X-Gitea-OTP` 头缺少重放校验两个问题。攻击者可在短时间窗口内并行提交请求，利用竞争条件或直接重放同一有效的 TOTP 验证码绕过单次使用限制，在未授权情况下完成登录。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.5.0 至 1.26.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，建议升级至 1.26.3 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20779","GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35Z","remediation":"升级 Gitea 至 1.26.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 TOTP 一次性验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 2FA 登录路径（/user/login/two_factor）添加速率限制，并禁用 Basic Auth 的 X-Gitea-OTP 头传递作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20779.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20779.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-20779.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6f4731f51e94154e3d2f88d907f7808a8b98f9a9/cve/CVE-2026-20779.html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-20779.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323/GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0246.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0246.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0246.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0244","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-14631","title":"Webpack webpack-dev-server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"webpack-dev-server 存在输入验证不当漏洞，未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标开发服务器发送包含格式错误 Host 标头的 HTTP 请求，或向默认 /ws 端点发送格式错误 Origin 标头的 WebSocket 升级请求，触发主机验证路径中的未捕获异常，导致 Node.js 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 webpack-dev-server 5.2.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。建议升级至 5.2.6 版本修复，或将开发服务器绑定至 localhost 避免暴露于不可信网络。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-14631","GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T18:16:24Z","updated":"2026-07-07T15:08:59Z","remediation":"立即将 webpack-dev-server 升级至 5.2.6 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，确保 dev server 仅监听 localhost（默认配置），切勿将其暴露到不可信网络中；可在反向代理或防火墙层面过滤含有异常 Host/Origin 标头的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/security/advisories/GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/webpack-dev-server/CVE-2026-14631.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-14631.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-14631.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj/GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/ericverret35/opsintel/blob/066e339688f1d946a07b54d213a43449e5764ac8/advisories/2026-07-20-ghsa-m28w-2pqf-7qgj.md","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/19a832a5a11c7c41b17a2495ce81341974b961f4/rss/openjs.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0243","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-14620","title":"Webpack webpack-dev-server 跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"webpack-dev-server 5.2.5 及之前版本中存在跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞。其内部开发端点 `/webpack-dev-server/open-editor` 和 `/webpack-dev-server/invalidate` 在处理 GET 请求时未验证请求来源，导致开发者在启动 dev server 后访问任意恶意网站时，该网站可跨域触发上述端点。攻击者可利用此漏洞在开发者编辑器中打开任意本地文件（包括项目根目录外的文件），并通过重复请求不断生成编辑器进程、强制触发重编译，从而消耗系统资源影响开发环境正常运行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危，建议升级至 webpack-dev-server 5.2.6 及以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-14620","GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T17:16:53Z","updated":"2026-07-07T15:12:43Z","remediation":"立即将 webpack-dev-server 升级至 5.2.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复内部端点未经验证的跨域请求问题。如无法升级，可在反向代理层屏蔽 `/webpack-dev-server/open-editor` 和 `/webpack-dev-server/invalidate` 路径的 GET 请求，并将 dev server 的 `--host` 绑定为 `127.0.0.1` 避免外部网络访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/security/advisories/GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/webpack-dev-server/CVE-2026-14620.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-14620.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-14620.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93/GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/Pig-Tail/security-research/blob/44468c09a73aabaafaeb4eab9b4e1d82d664d93d/README.md","https://github.com/slowslowgogo/SecurityReport/blob/91e0ad564eb640912bc932d6e24eba40983b0eb3/output/brief_2026-07-04.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0096","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54477","title":"Gardyn IoT Hub 管理面板安全标头缺失漏洞","description":"Gardyn IoT Hub 管理面板未设置标准 HTTP 安全响应头（如 X-Frame-Options、Content-Security-Policy、X-Content-Type-Options 等），攻击者可通过构造恶意页面嵌入管理面板框架实施点击劫持攻击，或结合其他攻击向量触发跨站脚本攻击。该漏洞影响 Gardyn IoT Hub 设备的内置管理面板，虽然需要管理员用户交互方可利用，但攻击者可能借此窃取管理员会话凭据或在授权上下文中执行非预期操作，对设备机密性和完整性构成中等风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54477"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-03T00:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-06T19:42:49Z","remediation":"确认 Gardyn IoT Hub 设备已联网，固件将自动更新至 master.627 及以上版本；Cloud API 已升级至 2.12.2026 及以上版本。在 Web 服务器或反向代理层为管理面板添加 Content-Security-Policy、X-Frame-Options: DENY、X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff 和 Strict-Transport-Security 等安全响应头，防止点击劫持和跨站脚本攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-183-03.json","https://mygardyn.com/security/","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-183-03","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-54477.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54477.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/7ddd42377be9a6b7218518cc45c52da044b527c3/2026/CVE-2026-54477.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-54477/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-54477.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Gardyn_IoT_Hub_%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%A0%87%E5%A4%B4%E7%BC%BA%E5%A4%B1_CVE-2026-54477.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9qxq-9wpj-4f86/GHSA-9qxq-9wpj-4f86.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54477.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54477.md","https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project/blob/1806ccc6eba1a35c05ed57465b8f2db26a2ee597/ICS-CERT_ADV/CISA_ICS_ADV_2026_7_16_26.csv","https://github.com/MichaelAdamGroberman/CVE-2026-54477","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54477"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0096.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0058","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13768","title":"Gardyn IoT Hub 硬编码凭据致未授权远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Gardyn IoT Hub 设备中存在硬编码的 iothubowner 高权限密钥（CWE-798），未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过获取该密钥即可调用 Azure IoT Hub Registry Manager 函数，获取所有 Gardyn Home Kit 和 Studio 设备的连接信息，进而对指定设备执行任意命令，并可利用该设备作为跳板攻击用户内网中的其他设备。CVSS 评分 9.5，危害等级严重。厂商尚未发布官方修复补丁，建议用户立即更换默认密钥并限制 IoT Hub 访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13768"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-03T00:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-06T19:42:32Z","remediation":"立即将 Gardyn Home/Studio 固件升级至 master.627 或更高版本，Gardyn Cloud API 升级至 2.12.2026 或更高，移动 App 升级至 2.11.0 或更高。确保设备持续联网以便自动接收安全更新；在 App 的 Settings → Advanced 中确认固件版本号为 627 及以上。若设备曾离线，重新联网后保持在线直至更新完成。厂商已轮换被泄露的 iothubowner 密钥并部署额外监控措施，用户无需自行配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-183-03.json","https://mygardyn.com/security/","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-183-03","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-13768.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-02/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13768.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bb6223196139bc0688b84a1421e9ebaaf1270e61/2026/CVE-2026-13768.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-13768/README.md","https://github.com/J4ck3LSyN-Gen2/Reports/blob/c7ee1544ae03025fd7749dd30f9be169a83d194d/OS-IS-CVE-2026-13768-07-2026.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-13768.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-13768.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Gardyn_IoT_Hub_%E7%A1%AC%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%87%AD%E6%8D%AE%E8%87%B4%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83_RCE_CVE-2026-13768.toml","https://github.com/psocik/ict/blob/754a501733fcc157dd813308ca9704bc2f17e229/_posts/2026/2026-07-02-CVE-2026-13768-Gardyn-IoT-Hub-Use-of-Hard-coded-Credentials.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13768.json","https://github.com/J4ck3LSyN-Gen2/CVE-2026-13768","https://github.com/MichaelAdamGroberman/CVE-2026-13768","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-13768"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0058.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0876","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0876.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13054","title":"WatchGuard Fireware OS Management Web UI 路径遍历任意文件写入漏洞","description":"WatchGuard Fireware OS 管理 Web UI 存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），具有高权限的认证攻击者可通过向管理界面发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用不充分的路径过滤机制突破目录限制，在 Firebox 文件系统上写入任意文件。该漏洞影响 Fireware OS 11.0 至 11.12.4_Update1、12.0 至 12.12 及 2025.1 至 2026.2 版本，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。攻击者需具备管理权限方可利用，成功利用后可写入恶意文件导致设备配置篡改或进一步权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13054"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-03T00:16:50Z","updated":"2026-07-10T12:58:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Fireware OS 至修复版本：2025.1 系列升级至 2026.2.1，12.x 系列升级至 12.12.1，12.5.x 系列（T15/T35 型号）升级至 12.5.19。Fireware OS 11.x 已终止支持，须升级至受支持版本。可通过 WatchGuard System Manager 或 Web UI 的\"系统升级\"功能安装对应固件。如无法立即升级，建议限制管理 Web UI 仅对受信任内部 IP 开放访问，并在防火墙上配置访问控制列表（ACL）限制管理端口（默认 8080/8443）的暴露范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.watchguard.com/wgrd-psirt/advisory/wgsa-2026-00028","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13054.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13054.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-13054.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-13054.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-02/TIER_3_CVE-2026-13054.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-13054.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/b