 WatchGuard Cloud 或 Fireware Web UI，进入 System > Software Update，下载并安装对应版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Management Web UI 中限制管理访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 连接，并禁用非必要的无线客户端管理功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.watchguard.com/wgrd-psirt/advisory/wgsa-2026-00029","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-02/TIER_3_CVE-2026-13050.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-130xx/CVE-2026-13050.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/223bd6ef36843a3278e36983fe884608e497c8db/content/posts/cve-2026-13050.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/59d57936496f37081433ba541bca8c4d04c17f7f/api/2026/CVE-2026-13050.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0873.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0105","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54998","title":"Microsoft Exchange Online 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Online 存在授权不当漏洞（CWE-863），已获得合法身份认证的攻击者可利用网络向 Exchange Online 服务发送特制请求，绕过权限检查机制实现权限提升，进而访问超出自身授权范围的敏感资源。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Exchange Online 服务，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54998"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-02T23:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-07T05:16:52Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已于 2026 年 7 月安全更新中服务端修复此漏洞，Exchange Online 用户无需手动安装补丁。建议管理员登录 Microsoft 365 管理门户确认服务健康状态（Service Health Dashboard），确保组织已处于最新更新轨道（Current Channel）。作为纵深防御措施，可启用 Exchange 管理员审计日志（Set-AdminAuditLogConfig -UnifiedAuditLogIngestionEnabled $true）并监控异常权限提升行为，同时遵循最小权限原则审查服务主体（Service Principal）和应用权限分配。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-54998","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-54998.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54998.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54998.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-02/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54998.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54998/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54998.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/78453fda61545f56ec9c1e2f8e5aa78adf2aa3c6/app/routes/posts/2026-07-03_CVE-2026-54998.mdx","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Microsoft_Exchange_Online_%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87_CVE-2026-54998.toml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54998.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b80e198eccaa13040dbe03d79f3c9c06085d067/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-p